### ==========================================
### GESTION DE TRANSPORTE - VIAJES
### ==========================================

### TOKEN DE AUTENTICACION
@token =

### ==========================================
### CRUD DE VIAJES
### ==========================================

### LISTAR TODOS LOS VIAJES
GET http://localhost:3000/api/viajes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### REGISTRAR VIAJE
POST http://localhost:3000/api/viajes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "vehiculo_id": 2,
    "conductor_id": 2,
    "fecha_salida": "2026-11-16 08:00:00",
    "fecha_llegada": "2026-11-16 14:00:00",
    "origen": "La Rioja",
    "destino": "Cordoba",
    "kilometros": 450,
    "observaciones": "Viaje de prueba"
}


### OBTENER VIAJE POR ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/viajes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ACTUALIZAR VIAJE
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/viajes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "vehiculo_id": 2,
    "conductor_id": 2,
    "fecha_salida": "2026-11-16 08:00:00",
    "fecha_llegada": "2026-11-16 15:00:00",
    "origen": "La Rioja",
    "destino": "Cordoba",
    "kilometros": 460,
    "observaciones": "Viaje actualizado"
}

### ELIMINAR VIAJE
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/viajes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==========================================
### HISTORIALES
### ==========================================

### HISTORIAL DE VIAJES POR VEHICULO
GET http://localhost:3000/api/viajes/historial/vehiculo/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### HISTORIAL DE VIAJES POR CONDUCTOR
GET http://localhost:3000/api/viajes/historial/conductor/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==========================================
### KILOMETROS TOTALES
### ==========================================

### KILOMETROS TOTALES POR VEHICULO
GET http://localhost:3000/api/viajes/kilometros/vehiculo/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### KILOMETROS TOTALES POR CONDUCTOR
GET http://localhost:3000/api/viajes/kilometros/conductor/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
